	<FactionDef ParentName="RatkinFactionBadBase">
		<defName>Rakinia_Warlord</defName>
		<label>Fallen-Rat Junta</label>
		<description>A country that split off from amongst the Ratkin Kingdom and relies on war to maintain its fragile economy. \n\nBecause the entire country's income was extremely dependent on the military industry, this faction showed extreme aggression towards all outsiders. Once the war stopped, a broken financial chain would mean the end of this country. \n\nThe Ratkin Warlord's internal oppression has also reached an extreme, with almost every ratkin citizen hovering on the subsistence line. Every year, many ratkins would dump everything they had and try to escape back to the Ratkin Kingdom.</description>
		<colorSpectrum>
			<li>(176, 23, 31)</li>
			<li>(176, 23, 31)</li>
		</colorSpectrum>
		<naturalEnemy>true</naturalEnemy>
	</FactionDef>
	
